  "description": "Entity Framework Core store and change capture for DotNetBoost.Auditing. A\n      SaveChangesInterceptor reads the change tracker and appends the audit rows into the same\n      SaveChanges — so a change and its trail commit together or neither does — and the two tables\n      are mapped into your own DbContext with the indexes the library's own reads need. Supports\n      SQL Server, PostgreSQL and SQLite.",
